message: >-
  If you use these datasets, please cite both the repository
  and the associated journal article below.
title: >-
  Datasets for "A Wireless Autonomous Real-Time Underwater
  Acoustic Positioning System"
abstract: >-
  Datasets used to evaluate the real-time acoustic tracking system
  developed by the STELLA MARE laboratory, including performance
  analyses of accuracy, reconstruction rate, and power consumption.
type: dataset
